OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BIFA 'positive' over upgrades needed    
OL,5,Bfor World Cup                          
OL,6,GThe Irish Football Association's       
OL,7,Gdirector of women's football Angela    
OL,8,GPlatt said the organisation is "still  
OL,9,Gworking through" plans with the        
OL,10,GNorthern Ireland government to ensure  
OL,11,Gthere is funding available to make the 
OL,12,Gnecessary upgrades to Windsor Park in  
OL,13,Gtime for the 2035 World Cup.           
OL,15,FIt was confirmed on Monday that        
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland, England, Scotland    
OL,17,Fand Wales, the only bidders for the    
OL,18,Ftournament in nine years' time, had    
OL,19,Fbeen ratified as co-hosts.             
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
