OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BSt Eunan's lament 'injustice' of       
OL,5,BUlster exit                            
OL,6,GSt Eunan's have lamented the           
OL,7,G"injustice" of the manner of their     
OL,8,Gdefeat by Scotstown in Saturday's      
OL,9,GUlster Club SFC semi-final at Brewster 
OL,10,GPark.                                  
OL,12,FThe Letterkenny side lost out 4-2 on   
OL,13,Fpenalties, but were left questioning   
OL,14,Fthe decision to award a Scotstown      
OL,15,Fequaliser at the end of extra-time     
OL,16,Fwhich sent the game into a shoot-out.  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
