OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BGallagher retires due to issues 'out   
OL,5,Bof my control'                         
OL,6,GJames Gallagher has cited              
OL,7,G"circumstances and stipulations        
OL,8,Goutside of my control" for his         
OL,9,Gdecision to retire from mixed martial  
OL,10,Garts (MMA).                            
OL,12,FThe 30-year-old from Strabane in       
OL,13,FCounty Tyrone announced his decision   
OL,14,Fto end his career with a record of 13  
OL,15,Fwins and four defeats, confirming      
OL,16,F"when the time comes, I will speak"    
OL,17,Fabout the full reason behind his       
OL,18,Fstepping away from the octagon.        
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
