OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BBSB chance 'too good to turn down' for 
OL,5,BLaverty                                
OL,6,GAn opportunity to compete in the       
OL,7,GBritish Superbike Championship (BSB)   
OL,8,Gin 2027 was "too good to turn down"    
OL,9,Gfor Eugene Laverty who will come out   
OL,10,Gof retirement next year.               
OL,12,FThe 40-year-old County Antrim rider    
OL,13,Fstepped away from full-time racing in  
OL,14,F2022 but has opted to make a shock     
OL,15,Freturn in a new two-rider FleetSafe    
OL,16,FDucati team.                           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
